flowchart How solve_dependencies resolves one dependant
// From: fastapi/dependencies/utils.py:643-792
(Solve a dependant) -> <Another sub-dependant left?>
<Another sub-dependant left?> -yes-> <Any dependency override registered?>
<Any dependency override registered?> -yes-> [Rebuild the dependant with get_dependant]
<Any dependency override registered?> -no-> [Solve the sub-dependant recursively]
[Rebuild the dependant with get_dependant] -> [Solve the sub-dependant recursively]
[Solve the sub-dependant recursively] -> <Did it return errors?>
<Did it return errors?> -yes-> [Collect the errors]
[Collect the errors] -> <Another sub-dependant left?>
<Did it return errors?> -no-> <Cached value for this call?>
<Cached value for this call?> -yes-> [Reuse the cached value]
<Cached value for this call?> -no-> <Generator function?>
<Generator function?> -yes-> [Enter it on the request or function exit stack]
<Generator function?> -no-> <Coroutine function?>
<Coroutine function?> -yes-> [Await the call]
<Coroutine function?> -no-> [Run the call in a thread pool]
[Reuse the cached value] -> [Store the value under the parameter name]
[Enter it on the request or function exit stack] -> [Store the value under the parameter name]
[Await the call] -> [Store the value under the parameter name]
[Run the call in a thread pool] -> [Store the value under the parameter name]
[Store the value under the parameter name] -> <Another sub-dependant left?>
<Another sub-dependant left?> -no-> [Validate path query header and cookie params]
[Validate path query header and cookie params] -> <Body params declared?>
<Body params declared?> -yes-> [Validate the body with request_body_to_args]
<Body params declared?> -no-> [Inject Request Response BackgroundTasks and SecurityScopes]
[Validate the body with request_body_to_args] -> [Inject Request Response BackgroundTasks and SecurityScopes]
[Inject Request Response BackgroundTasks and SecurityScopes] -> (Return values and errors)
note "Another sub-dependant left?" The loop is a for statement at dependencies/utils.py:676.
note "Any dependency override registered?" The rebuild runs whenever the app has any dependency_overrides, not only for this call (utils.py:680-696).
note "Did it return errors?" utils.py:710. Errors are collected and the loop continues.
note "Cached value for this call?" utils.py:717, keyed by _get_cache_key.
note "Generator function?" utils.py:719-729. The exit stack is the function stack when scope is function.
note "Validate path query header and cookie params" request_params_to_args, utils.py:738-757.
note "Body params declared?" utils.py:758-768.
